    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nREA Seamus Carthy are delighted to present New to Market, No. 15 Stonecourt, Roscommon Town. Step into effortless town centre living with this beautifully presented two-bedroom duplex apartment. Spanning two expertly designed floors, this property combines the spacious feel of a townhouse with the ultimate convenience of a central urban location. Presented in immaculate, walk-in condition, the property is being sold fully furnished, offering an exceptional turn-key specification for immediate occupancy. Whether you are a first-time buyer looking for a stylish start, a downsizer seeking total convenience, or an investor tracking a high-yield opportunity, this residence ticks every box. This exceptional duplex apartment is perfectly elevated on the second and third floors of this highly regarded three-storey complex. The thoughtful design features a reversed layout to maximize natural light and privacy, positioning the sleeping quarters on Level 2 with two spacious double bedrooms and a modern main bathroom. Level 3 opens into a spectacular, light-filled open-plan living, dining, and kitchen space, specifically designed to showcase panoramic, beautiful views of Roscommon Town and the historic Roscommon Castle.Immediate enquiries advised.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Exceptional Location, Heart of Roscommon Town\nPresented in Pristine Condition\nSold Fully Furnished\nFirst time buyers, downsizers, investors\nService Charge incl Ins, Bins,Common Areas - €1450\nThis exceptional duplex apartment is perfectly elevated on the second and third floors of this highly regarded three-storey complex. The thoughtful design features a reversed layout to maximize natural light and privacy, positioning the sleeping quarters on Level 2 with two spacious double bedrooms and a modern main bathroom. Level 3 opens into a spectacular, light-filled open-plan living, dining, and kitchen space, specifically designed to showcase panoramic, beautiful views of Roscommon Town and the historic Roscommon Castle. \n All Main Services \n Perfectly positioned in the heart of Roscommon Town, No. 15 Stonecourt offers an unbeatable turn-key lifestyle with premium amenities just steps from your door. Within a short stroll, residents enjoy effortless access to SuperValu, vibrant local cafes, pharmacies, and boutique shopping, alongside excellent commuter links via the nearby Roscommon Train Station. The highly secure complex features private gated access, elevator services, and ample residential parking, while cultural highlights like Roscommon Arts Centre and the historic Roscommon Castle and Park are virtually on your doorstep."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER Number: 106605728"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "No. 15 Stonecourt boasts a premier, highly coveted location right in the vibrant centre of Roscommon Town. This landmark address places you at the very heart of the town's social and commercial hub, where daily life requires no car. Steps from your door are bustling shopping streets, SuperValu, essential services, and local schools, balanced beautifully by the scenic green spaces of Roscommon Castle and Park just moments away. Combining the energy of urban town living with exceptional commuter connectivity via the nearby train station, it is the ultimate location for absolute convenience and lifestyle."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Seamus Carthy"
      }
